  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>variogram-cell-keys · 5×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1280 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-variogram-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-variogram-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const valuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; values: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const cellKeysOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; cellKeys: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const rowIdsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; rowIds: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const valueTermsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; valueTerms: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const COLUMNS: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const ROWS: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const CELL_COUNT: u32 = 4096u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const CELL_MARGIN: f32 = 1.0009765625;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">struct Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  valid: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  minimumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  minimumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  maximumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  maximumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  cellWidth: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  cellHeight: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  columns: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  rows: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  maximumDistance: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  radiusSquared: f32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">fn readParameter(slot: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  return parameters[parametersOffset + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">fn readLattice() -&gt; Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  var lattice: Lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  lattice.cellWidth = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  lattice.cellHeight = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  lattice.columns = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  lattice.rows = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  lattice.radiusSquared = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let minimumX = readParameter(0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let minimumY = readParameter(1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let maximumX = readParameter(2u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let maximumY = readParameter(3u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let radius = readParameter(4u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let width = maximumX - minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let height = maximumY - minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let radiusSquared = radius * radius;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let cellRadius = radius * CELL_MARGIN;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  lattice.valid =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    isFiniteFloat(minimumX) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(minimumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(maximumX) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    isFiniteFloat(maximumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(radius) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(width) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    isFiniteFloat(height) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(radiusSquared) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(cellRadius) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    radius &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; width &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; height &gt;= 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  if (!lattice.valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  lattice.minimumX = minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  lattice.minimumY = minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  lattice.maximumX = maximumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  lattice.maximumY = maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  lattice.cellWidth = max(width / f32(COLUMNS), cellRadius);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  lattice.cellHeight = max(height / f32(ROWS), cellRadius);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  lattice.columns = min(COLUMNS - 1u, u32(floor(width / lattice.cellWidth))) + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  lattice.rows = min(ROWS - 1u, u32(floor(height / lattice.cellHeight))) + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  lattice.maximumDistance = radius;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  lattice.radiusSquared = radiusSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">fn isPointValid(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  return lattice.valid &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(y) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    x &gt;= lattice.minimumX &amp;&amp; x &lt;= lattice.maximumX &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">    y &gt;= lattice.minimumY &amp;&amp; y &lt;= lattice.maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">fn getCellColumn(lattice: Lattice, x: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  return min(u32(floor((x - lattice.minimumX) / lattice.cellWidth)), lattice.columns - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">fn getCellRow(lattice: Lattice, y: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  return min(u32(floor((y - lattice.minimumY) / lattice.cellHeight)), lattice.rows - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">// A runtime operand keeps the quiet-NaN bit pattern out of constant evaluation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">fn getQuietNaN(seed: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (seed &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">fn getOrderedFloatKey(value: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  let bits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  return select(bits | 0x80000000u, ~bits, (bits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">fn getOrderedFloatValue(key: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(select(~key, key &amp; 0x7fffffffu, (key &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"113\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"114\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  _ = &amp;values;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  _ = &amp;cellKeys;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  _ = &amp;rowIds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  _ = &amp;valueTerms;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  let lattice = readLattice();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  let x = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  let y = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  let included = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  let value = values[valuesOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  let valid = included &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(value) &amp;&amp; isPointValid(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">  var key = CELL_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">  if (valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">    key = getCellRow(lattice, y) * lattice.columns + getCellColumn(lattice, x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  cellKeys[cellKeysOffset + index] = key;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  rowIds[rowIdsOffset + index] = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  valueTerms[valueTermsOffset + index] = select(0.0, value, valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"variogram-parameters\">variogram-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>values<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall\">rainfall</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>cellKeys<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"variogram-cell-keys\">variogram-cell-keys</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>rowIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"variogram-row-ids\">variogram-row-ids</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>valueTerms<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"variogram-value-terms\">variogram-value-terms</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUVariogram/cell-keys · main · 5edfd760</figcaption></figure></section>",
